WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.678
"Mam na n gõeame, m gãagẽ wã sɛɛgẽ, n kogl-a ne fãadbã".

00:00:04.758 --> 00:00:10.795
Daar fãa yʋngo, a ra kẽeda gãagẽ wã n dɩtẽ hal t'a ra pa le tõe n dɩ ye.

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:14.533
Zĩ-kãnga ra yikdame, la a pʋgã ra wẽnemdame.

00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:16.996
A yeelame tɩ yaa bõn-naandse.

00:00:17.076 --> 00:00:27.276
Yãk-y n tool-y neda, y sã n dat n bãng bũmb ning y sẽn maandã, bɩ y bãng-y bũmb ning sẽn tõe n sõng-y tɩ y tall sũ-noogo.
